---
title: "Research Projects — Situational AI"
description: "Student and collaborator research projects on Situational AI: the question, the status, the people, and the manuscript when there is one."
ogTitle: "Research Projects — Situational AI"
nav: "research"
navbarScrolled: true
layout: "layouts/base.njk"
---
  <header class="blog-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="section-tag">Research projects</span>
        <h1>Visible Work, Not a Downloads Page</h1>
        <p class="section-subtitle">Each project is a question, the people pursuing it, and where it stands. Manuscripts appear here as they are supplied.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="section" style="padding-top: 0;">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="blog-list">
        {%- for pr in projects %}
        {%- set researchers = people | bySlugs(pr.people) %}
        {%- set academics = people | bySlugs(pr.academic) %}
        <a href="{{ pr.url }}" class="blog-list-card project-card">
          <div>
            <div class="blog-card-tag">{{ pr.kind }}</div>
            <h3>{{ pr.title }}</h3>
            <p class="project-question">{{ pr.question }}</p>
            <p>{{ pr.lede }}</p>
            <div class="project-meta">
              <span class="status-label">{{ pr.status }}</span>
              <span class="event-list-meta">{% for r in researchers %}{{ r.name }}{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %}{% if academics.length %} · with {% for a in academics %}{{ a.name }}{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %}{% endif %}{% if not pr.manuscript %} · manuscript pending{% endif %}</span>
            </div>
            <span class="blog-list-date">View research &rarr;</span>
          </div>
        </a>
        {%- endfor %}
      </div>
      <p class="event-list-meta" style="text-align:center; margin-top: 32px;">Status labels: Open Question · Hypothesis · Research in Progress · Experiment · Preliminary · Manuscript · Published · Needs Replication · Archived.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-dark">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="section-tag">Take one on</span>
        <h2>The Questions Are the Work</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">Every project here began as an open question. There are more of those than there are people.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-actions" style="margin-bottom:0;">
        <a href="/research/open-questions.html" class="btn btn-primary">See the Open Questions</a>
        <a href="/participate.html" class="btn btn-outline">Participate</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
